# The glTF source assets, 46 MB of it, 35 MB of that seven texture files.
# UNTRACKED PENDING A DECISION, not permanently: git history is forever, this
# repo goes public, and it seeds six pod repos for the riff, so committing the
# raw textures is the one step here that cannot be undone. The loaders
# normalise from MEASURED bounds, so swapping in compressed textures needs no
# code change -- deleting these two lines is the whole of "ship them as-is".
# Until then the game runs on its documented asset-failure fallback (§2).
public/models/
